# Butler Routes - Teldrassil rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 19 confirmed rares and the fixed world containers
# of Teldrassil. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core route or
# standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up never holds the route.
# Spawn points, levels and loot are the local Forever game data (questie-forever);
# respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. Named mobs that are
# core-route quest objectives or quest-item sources (Oakenscowl, Lord Melenas,
# Xethorr the Wicked, Hatescreech, Windmistress Gaedress, Githyiss the Vile, the
# Befouled Webwood) are NOT here: the core guide covers their quests. The
# Moss-twined Heart that Blackmoss carries starts a contracted core quest; the
# hunt lives here, the accept lives there. See
# docs/teldrassil-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory this guide was
# built against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/teldrassil-rares
title Teldrassil - Rares & Treasures
levels 1-10
zone Teldrassil
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords teldrassil, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

