step Blackmoss the Fetid — the north

  loop
  goto 42.43,37.84
  goto 42.81,28.39
  goto 43.26,27.02
  goto 43.96,29.56
  kill 3535 optional
  collect 5179 "Moss-twined Heart" optional
  collect 284167 "Blackmoss Robes" optional
  note Level 13 rare, above the zone band but the hunt the brief names: his Heart starts the contracted core quest The Moss-twined Heart (927), so take it if it drops and hand it to Denalan — the core route covers the quest and never waits on the drop.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Calico Tunic, Calico Gloves); respawn timer unconfirmed.

