step Vorlus Vilehoof — central Teldrassil

  goto 47.25,63.6
  kill 6128 optional
  collect 6805 "Horn of Vorlus" optional
  note Level 10 rare. His Horn is sought by Elanaria's Darnassus-city quest Vorlus Vilehoof (1683, not in the core contract — a city-variant quest the core route does not cover).
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Ragged Leather Vest, Frayed Shoes); respawn timer unconfirmed.

