step Duskstalker — the southeast

  goto 58.15,76.65
  kill 14430 optional
  task "Tame it instead of killing it" optional only Hunter
  collect 284165 "Duskstalker's Hide" optional
  note Level 9 rare cat, stealthed. The seed put him at (56, 76); the data has him two points east, and the data wins. Nightsabers are hunter-tameable, and the core route's own taming chain tames a Nightsaber Stalker.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Warrior's Shield, Journeyman's Vest); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Ferocitas the Dream Eater — the east

  goto 69.37,53.41
  kill 7234 optional
  collect 8049 "Gnarlpine Necklace" optional
  note Level 8 rare. The contracted core quest Ferocitas the Dream Eater (2459) is named for him but its objectives kill Gnarlpine Mystics, not him — he is not a core kill, so the hunt ships with his own loot.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Ragged Leather Vest, Ragged Leather Pants); respawn timer unconfirmed.

